{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"### Webhook lastNode response mode

Source: https://github.com/n8n-io/n8n-docs/blob/main/docs/integrations/builtin/core-nodes/n8n-nodes-base.webhook/README.md

Defines the core lastNode response mode — the webhook returns the response code and data output from the last executed node, enabling test harnesses where a Code node (as the final node) dynamically constructs the HTTP response.

```markdown
### Respond

* **Immediately**: The Webhook node returns the response code and the message **Workflow got started**.
* **When Last Node Finishes**: The Webhook node returns the response code and the data output from the last node executed in the workflow.
* **Using 'Respond to Webhook' Node**: The Webhook node responds as defined in the Respond to Webhook node.
* **Streaming response**: Enables real-time data streaming back to the user as the workflow processes.
```

